==English==

===Noun===

{{wikipedia|complex (chemistry)}}
'''[[coordination]] [[compound]]'''

# {{chemistry}} a class of compounds in which a [[central]] [[metal]] [[atom]] (normally a [[transition element]]) is surrounded by a group of [[ion]]s or [[molecule]]s ([[ligand]]s)
Complex Compound
These are the componds in which the central metal atom is surrounded by ligands by co-ordinate covalent bonds. These compounds do not lose their identity even in solution. For example [Cu(NH4)6]-- will not give individual tests for Cu++ and NH4+ ions

